      "headline": "CISSP, Cybersecurity Leader",
      "about": "Cybersecurity Leader | Strategic Communicator | Team Builder | Leadership Practitioner\n\nA dynamic and mission-driven Cybersecurity Strategist with 18 years of proven leadership in building, developing, and mentoring high-performing cybersecurity teams during my tenure as a U.S. Air Force Officer. My leadership philosophy centers on empowering people—recognizing that valuing team members and celebrating their contributions is a powerful force multiplier in any organization.\n\nI excel at strategic communication, problem-solving, and troubleshooting complex challenges. My critical thinking allows me to identify root causes and distill them into actionable insights for senior and executive decision-makers. I bridge the gap between technical realities and strategic objectives, ensuring cybersecurity is both understood and prioritized at all levels.\n\nA lifelong student of leadership, I am guided by the Five Practices of Exemplary Leadership by Kouzes and Posner:\n\nModel the Way\n\nInspire a Shared Vision\n\nChallenge the Process\n\nEnable Others to Act\n\nEncourage the Heart\n\nI am passionate about fostering inclusive, values-driven workplace cultures where team members are empowered to perform at their highest level. I seek opportunities where I can continue shaping environments that champion innovation, collaboration, and operational excellence in cybersecurity",
